OL,3,CModel village brings back tiny topless
OL,4,Cstreaker after backlash from public
OL,6,FA topless streaker figurine which was
OL,7,Fremoved from a model village on the
OL,8,FIsle of Wight following complaints is
OL,9,Fset to return.
OL,11,FModel Village Godshill recently
OL,12,Fremoved the character, known as Erica
OL,13,Fthe Streaker, on its miniature
OL,14,Ffootball pitch, sparking an outcry
OL,15,Ffrom some locals.
OL,17,FBosses at the tourist attraction
OL,18,Flaunched a social media poll asking
OL,19,Fthe public to decide Erica's fate and
OL,20,F98 per cent (5,023 people) voted to
OL,21,Fbring her back.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
