OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785952107
OL,3,CModel village brings back tiny topless
OL,4,Cstreaker after backlash from public
OL,6,FThe model village said: "We've decided
OL,7,Fshe will be returning...but with a
OL,8,Ftwist, as we want her return to do
OL,9,Fsome good."
OL,11,FInstead of standing on the football
OL,12,Fpitch, she will be popping up in
OL,13,Fdifferent locations around the gardens.
OL,15,FVisitors will be encouraged to keep
OL,16,Ftheir eyes peeled to spot where she's
OL,17,Fhiding next.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
