PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785952107
OL,3,CModel village brings back tiny topless
OL,4,Cstreaker after backlash from public
OL,6,FThe tourist attraction added: "Each
OL,7,Fappearance will help raise awareness
OL,8,Fand funds for our chosen Breast Cancer
OL,9,Fcharity - The Breast Friends Isle of
OL,10,FWight.
OL,12,F"It feels like a fitting way for one
OL,13,Fof our most talked-about residents to
OL,14,Fsupport an important cause.
OL,16,F"At Model Village Godshill, we've
OL,17,Falways loved our hidden jokes and
OL,18,Fquirky characters for visitors to
OL,19,Fdiscover. Our streaker will continue
OL,20,Fthat tradition in a fresh way that we
OL,21,Fhope people of all ages can enjoy."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/3
